# KnowAnswer API 手工测试

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/knowledge-bases
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "default", "description": ""}

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/knowledge-bases

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/knowledge-bases/1/files
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./data/example.txt
--WebAppBoundary--

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/files/1

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{"knowledge_base_id": 1, "title": ""}

###

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{"conversation_id": 1, "question": "这份文档讲了什么？"}
